**The one thing most likely to break it:** The comparison is case-sensitive. If `loyalty_tier` is stored as `"gold"` (lowercase) or `"GOLD"` (uppercase) instead of `"Gold"`, the match fails and everyone hits the generic copy. Check a real profile in **Preview & test** to confirm the exact capitalization, then adjust the strings in the code to match.

